(cherry picked from commit 23f86fc3ac9e8fb815256db9561119ac288d76d4)
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/3rdparty/canonical/linux-noble/+/3427658
Reviewed-by: Jon Hunter <jonathanh@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Brad Griffis <bgriffis@nvidia.com>
Tested-by: Jon Hunter <jonathanh@nvidia.com>
